[I] An extremely fast non-cryptographic hash algorithm

[T] xxHash is an extremely fast non-cryptographic hash algorithm, working at
[T] speeds close to RAM limits. It is proposed in two flavors, 32 and 64 bits.

[U] https://www.xxhash.com/

